      "reason": "Include the existing owning dispatcher.h declarations for subscribe_int, unsubscribe_int and interrupt_loop. Original game.c omitted them and calls crossed an implicit variadic ABI, causing WASM subscribe_int trap after the SDK time fix. Strict actual-source compile fails for all three undeclared calls before the include and passes afterward."
