      "reason": "Synchronize first PS/2 packet only while expecting its first header byte. Original first_packet branch also tested payload bit3 and reset byte_counter midpacket, losing valid initial dx/dy bytes 9/9 and 26/232. Actual owning parser fails packet-completion/coordinate assertions before repair and passes both positive and negative movement packets afterward."
